    "chunk_text": "I. Description of the Land.\u2013 Allotments of land depicted in below names and extents in the Cadastral Map C.M.No. 310214, Block No. 02, Sheet No. 01 dated 07.11.2023 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Habaragahamada (Old Nalanda and Pilihudugolla) in No. E 410C, Habaragahamada Grama Niladhari Division in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Naula in Matale District of Central Province and bounded as follows.\n\nII. Description of Servitude.\u2013 Acquisition of servitude of the land for the construction of the Bowathenna Tunnel and contructions related to the North Western Province Canal Project.\n\nIII fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'08'15PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 15.08.2025 2A\n\n02. Lot No.4 \u2013 Habaragahamada \u2013 Extent:0.0139 Hectare North: Lot No.3, Lot No.1 in F.V.P. 253 and Lot No. 309 in F.V.P. 253; East: Lot No. 309 in F.V.P. 253; South: Lot No.5; West: Lot Nos.5, 2 and 3.\n\n03. Lot No.5 \u2013 Habaragahamada \u2013 Extent:0.3158 Hectare North: Lot Nos.2,3,4, Lot No.309 in F.V.P.253 and Lot No.6 of this plan; East: Lot No.4, Lot No.309 in F.V.P.253, Lot Nos.6,8 and 7 of this plan; South: Lot No.7, Lot No. 545 in F.V.P. 252 and Lot No.309 in F.V.P. 253; West: Lot No. 309 in F.V.P. 253. Lot No.2 of this plan.\n\n04. Lot No.6 \u2013 Habaragahamada \u2013 Extent:0.0195 Hectare North: Lot No.309 in F.V.P.253; East: Lot No.309 in F.V.P.253, Lot No.545 in F.V.P. 252 and Lot No.8 of this plan; South: Lot Nos.8,7 and 5; West: Lot No.5.\n\n05. Lot No.7 \u2013 Meegolleyaya \u2013 Extent:0.0008 Hectare North: Lot Nos.5 and 6; East: Lot No.8; South: Lot No.8 and Lot No.545 in and F.V.P. 252; West: Lot No. 545 in F.V.P. 252, Lot No. 309 in F.V.P. 253 and Lot No. 5 of this Plan."
