    "chunk_size_bytes": 2146,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2449/73 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 16 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dd9\u0dc3\u0db1\u0dc3\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.16\n\nNo. 2449/73 \u2013 SATURDAY, AUGUST 16, 2025 - 16.08.2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) Notice under Section 7 I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land as it is required for public purpose. Description of the land to be acquired:- The allotments of land in total extent of about 0.4481 hectare depicted as Sheet No. 01 in Block No. 02 in the Cadastral Map No. 830255 of the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Ridiyagama, in Ridiyagama Grama Niladhari Division, No. 129, in Magam Pattuwa Minor Division, in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Ambalantota, in Hambantota District, and bounded as follows.\n\n01. Lot No. 03 Name of the Land: Koggala Kele; Description of the land: Home Garden, 06 Permanent buildings, 03 water tanks, one water tower, water acrator and a mixed crop cultivation; Claimants: State; Original Claimant: Ambalantota Pradeshiya Sabha; Statutory provisions and reasons for survey: Required for the National Water Supply Board; Extent: 0.4396 Hectare. 02. Lot No. 04 Name of the Land: Koggala Kele; Description of the land: Home Garden, a part of a permanent building and a part of the water tower; Claimants: State; Original Claimant: Ambalantota Pradeshiya Sabha; Statutory provisions and reasons for survey: Has been transferred to the Dept. of Irrigation. Regquired for the National Water Supply Board; Extent: 0.0085 Hectare. All persons who claim ownership, interested or any other connection to the aforesaid land hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me on 22nd September, 2025 at 10.30 a.m. at the Divisional Secretariat, Ambalantota."
  },
