    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.20PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 20.08.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2450/29 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 20 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0db6\u0daf\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.20No. 2450/29 \u2013 WEDNESDAY, AUGUST 20, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nThe allotments of land described as following names and extents, depicted in the Advance Tracing No. KU/BMK/2022/186 dated 10.11.2022, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated at the Village of Bogoda in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 1207 of Bogoda in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Bamunakotuwa in the District of Kurunegala, North Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Weralugolla Medikelemookalana \u2013 Extent: 0.1481 Hectare North: Home garden of the land of which name cannot be found claimed by Shantha Rathnayake and Weralugolla Medikelemookalana claimed by K. V. N. Samanthi Kumari; East: Weralugolla Medikelemookalana claimed by K. V. N. Samanthi Kumari, Lot B and Weralugolla Medikele-mookalana claimed by Nayomi Ridma Rasanjalee;\n\nSouth: Weralugolla Medikelemookalana claimed by Nayomi Ridma Rasanjalee and Galapamulahena claimed by D. Darmasena; West: Galapamulahena claimed by D. Darmasena and Home garden of the land of which name cannot be found claimed by Shantha Rathnayake."
