    "chunk_text": "REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998 Declaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14 BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land No. 1 : 175 of Block 1, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 420595, situated in the Village of Kohombapola within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 1585 - Kohombapola in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Pannala, in the District of Kurunegala, in the Province of North Western, referred to in Notice No. 42/0836 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2305/36 of 11th November, 2022 in terms of Section 12 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998. P. C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 06th June, 2025.\n\nAdjudication special or and personal Injunction law (Hectare) 1:175 0.7569 Ranathunga Arachchige 912210898V Full 1st Class Subject to the _ Hashinthana Priyasad mortgage Nos. Ranathunga 153 , 277 and Ethulmaldeniya Watta, 2020.08.08, Kohombapola, Pannala. 2021.12.03 dated to the C/S Katugampala Various Services Cooperative Society EOG 08-0225/6\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
