    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART I : SECTION (I) - GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A - PG 7231 - 284 (08/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nL.D.B. 21/1978(X)(D)THE UNIVERSITIES ACT, No. 16 OF 1978\n\nOrder under Section 27(l)(b) read with Section 25A\n\nBY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1)(b) read with Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, 1, Dr. Harini Amarasuriya, the Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education, having obtained a report under section 70C of the aforesaid Act, in respect of the SRI LANKA TECHNOLOGY CAMPUS (PVT) LIMITED, a company incorporated in Sri Lanka under the Companies Act, No.07 of 2007 and bearing registration number PV 101137, being recognized as a Degree Awarding Institute for the purpose of developing higher education leading to the award of the Bachelor of Science Honours in Engineering in Mechatronics Engineering by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2157/3 of January 6, 2020 and amended by Order published in Gazette Extraordinary No. 2308/29 of December 1, 2022, do hereby further amend the said Order by the substitution for the words \u201cminimum entry qualifications specified herein.\u201d appearing in proviso to paragraph (ii) of Condition 1 in Schedule I thereof, of the following:-\n\n\u201cminimum entry qualifications specified herein and shall be eligible to be awarded the Bachelor of Science Honours in Engineering in Mechatronics Engineering, to be effective from 07.05.2015, upon the successful completion of the said degree programme.\u201d.\n\nDr. Harini Amarasuriya, Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education.Colombo,August 06, 2025.\n\nEOG 08 - 0233/2\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
