    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2450$42 - 2025 wf.daia;= ui 21 jeks n%yiam;skaod - 2025'08'21No. 2450/42 - THURSDAY, AUGUST 21, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A - G 45201 - 05 (08/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nSPORTS ACT, No. 25 OF 1973\n\nThe order made by the Minister of Sports under the Sections 32 and 33 of theSports Act, No. 25 of 1973\n\nThe Extraordinary Gazette Notification No. 2386/08 dated 29.05.2024 is hereby amended.\n\nI, Sunil Kumara Gamage, Minister of Youth Affairs and Sports, temporarily suspend the registration of National Sports Associations / Federations for the sports stated below in terms of the powers vested with me under the Sections 32 and 33 of the Sports Act, No. 25 of 1973 and amendments. And, the Director General of the Department of Sports is hereby appointed as the competency authority with effect from 19th of August, 2025 to carry out administrative and other necessary matters of the said national sports federations in an appropriate manner as a temporary procedure, and to call and conduct an election.\n\n1. Sri Lanka Cycling Federation2. Sri Lanka Automobile Sports3. Netball Federation of Sri Lanka\n\nSunil Kumara Gamage (M.P.) Minister of Youth Affairs and Sports.\n\nColombo,19th August, 2025.\n\nEOG 08 - 0237"
