    "chunk_text": "\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2450/49 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dc1 \u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 22 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0dd2\u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.22\n\nNo. 2450/49 \u2013 FRIDAY, AUGUST 22, 2025\n\nPART III - LANDS\n\n2 A III \u0dc1\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc1\u0dda \u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dc2 \u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.22 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRA ORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 22.08.2025\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO\n\nLAND PARCELS\n\nRegistration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998\n\n(Section 12)\n\nNOTICE No. : 11/0754 ANURADHAPURA\n\nDISTRICT\n\nIt is hereby notified that any person having a claim to the ownership or possession or interest to one or more of the parcels of lands reflected in the Cadastral Map No. 110283 made by the Surveyor-General under Section 11 of the Registration of Title Act, No. 21 of 1998 relating to the village of Horuvila (Block 07, Sheet No. 02) or any part thereof, situated within the Grama Niladhari Division of No.355 - Horuvila in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Nochchiyagama in the District of Anuradhapura in the Province of North Central should submit his claim to the undersigned before 8th of September 2025 In the event of failure to submit any claim before the above-mentioned date, action will be taken to hold an ex parte inquiry to determine title to the land and accordingly publish such determination in the Government Gazette in terms of Section 14 of the above Act. The Cadastral Map No. 110283 referred to above may be perused at the relevant Grama Niladhari Office, Divisional Secretariat, District Survey Office, Office of the Commissioner of Title Settlement, or the Surveyor - General\u2019s office. Further information may be obtained from the Grama Niladhari, the Divisional Secretary, or the Commissioner of Title Settlement.\n\nP. C. D. Sigera, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement.\n\nLand Title Settlement Department, No.1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla, 06th August, 2025. EOG 08 - 0243/2\n\nNOTICE CALLING FOR CLAIMS TO"
