    "chunk_text": "(Published by Authority)\n\n\u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u0dba\u0dca \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u0dad\u0dd2 \u0dc0\u0dd2\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\nPART III - LANDS Title Registration REGISTRATION OF TITLE ACT, No. 21 OF 1998 Declaration of Determination of the Commissioner of Title Settlement under Section 14 BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby declare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land No. 109 of Block 02, contained in the Cadastral Map No. 620070, situated in the Village of Thalangama, within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 255C - Thalangama in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Balangoda, in the District of Rathnapura, in the Province of Sabaragamuwa, referred to in Notice calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 2423/12 of 10th February, 2025 in terms of Section 55 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. P.C. D. SIGERA, Commissioner General of Land Title Settlement Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 11th August, 2025\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2451/08 - 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u0ddd\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4 \u0db8\u0dc3 25 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u0db1\u0dd2 \u0dc3\u0db3\u0dd4\u0daf\u0dcf - 2025.08.25\n\nNo. 2451/08 \u2013 MONDAY, AUGUST 25, 2025\n\nN.B.\u2013 This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A - G 045236 - 04 (08/2025)\n\n2 A\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da