    "chunk_text": "w;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2451$27 - 2025 wf.daia;= ui 28 jeks \u2248n%yiam;skaod - 2025'08'28No. 2451/27 - THURSDAY, AUGUST 28, 2025\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART I : SECTION (I) \u2014 GENERAL\n\nGovernment Notifications\n\n1A - G 45263 - 05 (08/2025) This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nREGULATIONS MADE BY THE MINISTER OF YOUTH AFFAIRS AND SPORTS UNDER SECTION 41 READ WITH SECTION 31 OF THE SPORTS LAW No. 25 OF 1973 AS AMENDED\n\n01. I, Sunil Kumara Gamage, Minister of Youth Affairs and Sports, by virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 41 read with Section 31 of the Sports Law No. 25 of 1973 as amended, do hereby amend the Extraordinary Gazette bearing No. 2437/24 dated 21.05.2025, in the manner set out below.\n\n02. The Regulations of Sports Associations No. 01 of 2025, published under the aforesaid Gazette No. 2437/24 dated 21.05.2025, are hereby amended by the substitution of the following sub-paragraphs for sub-paragraphs (2) and (3) of Regulation 4:\n\n(2) Only individuals who possess the following qualifications shall be eligible for election to the positions set out in Section 4(1) (i), (ii), and (iv):\n\n(i) Have represented Sri Lanka in an international competition which has the approval of the Ministry of Sports; and/or\n\n(ii) Have secured first (1st), second (2nd), or third (3rd) place in an individual event at National Senior and/or Junior Championships organized by the relevant National Association or at the National Sports Festival; and/or Have been a member of a team which won the championship, runners-up, or second runners-up positions in team events; and/or\n\nI fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2025'08'28Part I : Sec. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF S