    "chunk_text": "III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.08.28\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.08.20251A\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\nThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialis t Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2451/35 \u2013 2025 \u0d85\u0dd9\u0d9c\u02a4\u0dc3\u0dca\u01b1 \u0db8\u0dc3 28 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.08.28\n\nNo. 2451/35 \u2013 THURSDAY, AUGUST 28, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 (a)\n\nOrder No. 84 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No.: 13/96/FR/470. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: KDS/MDB/4/2/1/71/04. BY virtue of the powers vested in me by the Order under Section 38(a) of Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby direct the Acquiring O\ufb03 cer or any other O\ufb03 cer authorized by him referred to Paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take possession of the Land speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in Paragraph 2 of that Schedule. K. D. L\u0d7a\u0d85 K\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/06, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,24th July, 2025.\n\n1A \u2013 G 045259 \u2013 19 (08/2025)\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring O\ufb03 cer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Medadumbara.\n\n2. Description of the Land.\u2013 An allotment of Land depicted in below name and extent in the Preliminary Plan No. \u0db8\u0dc4 5906 dated 28.01.2008 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the village called Mangoda in the Udasiyapattuwa South Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Medadumbara in Kandy District of Central Province and bounded as:\n\n01. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Galapamula Kale \u2013 Extent: 1.113 Hectares North: State-owned Rock Mountain; East: Lot No. 1 in P. P. \u0db8\u0dc4 5610; South: Lot No. 5 in P. P. \u0db8\u0dc4 7680; West: Lot No. 4 in P. P. \u0db8\u0dc4 7680.\n\nEOG 08-0301\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk"
