    "chunk_text": "01. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Galapamula Kale \u2013 Extent: 1.113 Hectares North: State-owned Rock Mountain; East: Lot No. 1 in P. P. \u0db8\u0dc4 5610; South: Lot No. 5 in P. P. \u0db8\u0dc4 7680; West: Lot No. 4 in P. P. \u0db8\u0dc4 7680.\n\nEOG 08-0301\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.08.20252A\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 (a)\n\nOrder No. 85 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No.: 13/96/FR/493. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: KDS/MDB/4/2/1/71/15. BY virtue of the powers vested in me by the Order under Section 38(a) of Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation, do hereby direct the Acquiring O\ufb03 cer or any other O\ufb03 cer authorized by him referred to Paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take possession of the Land speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in Paragraph 2 of that Schedule. K. D. L\u0d7a\u0d85 K\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/06, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,24th July, 2025.SCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring O\ufb03 cer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Medadumbara.\n\n2. Description of the Land.\u2013 An allotment of Land depicted in below name and extent in the Preliminary Plan No. \u0db8\u0dc4 5559 dated 22.11.2004 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the village called Mangoda in the Udasiyapattuwa South Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Medadumbara in Kandy District of Central Province and bounded as:\n\n01. Lot No. 1 \u2013 Aguruwalakale \u2013 Extent: 0.3900 Hectare North: T. P. 56154; East: T. P. 56154 and Angurupola Stream; South: Angurupola Stream and T. P. 56154; West: T. P. 56154.\n\nEOG 08-0302\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 (a)\n\nOrder No. 86 of 2025"
