    "chunk_size_bytes": 1878,
    "chunk_text": "Trade Union Front of National Savings Bank(Jathika Sevaka Sangamaya and Sri Lanka Independent Bank Employees Union)of the Other Part This Collective Agreement is made on this I6th day of July Two Thousand Twenty-four (16.07.2024) by and between the National Savings Bank of the One Part (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Bank\u201d) and the Trade Union Front of the Other Part (hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe Union\u201d), t he National Savings Bank and the Trade Union Front agree to the following.\n\n1. EMPLOYER TO BE COVERED AND BOUND\n\nThis Agreement shall cover and bind the National Savings Bank, which is a party to this Agreement.\n\n2. EMPLOYEES TO BE COVERED AND BOUND\n\nThis Agreement shall cover and bind members of the Trade Union Front in employment with the Bank and employees who are employed in any of the categories for which a salary scale has been prescribed in this Agreement in the Annex I hereto.\n\n3. DATE OF OPERATION AND DURATION\n\nThis Agreement shall come into force on First Day of January Two Thousand Twenty-Four (1st January 2024) and thereafter continue to be in force, unless it is determined by either party giving six months\u2019 prior notice in writing to the other party provided, however, that no party shall give such notice to the other party after the lst day of July 2026.\n\n4. MATTERS COVERED AND VARIATION OF TERMS AND CONDITIONS OF EMPLOYMENT AND BENEFITS\n\nThis Agreement shall be in full and \ufb01 nal settlement of all matters covered herein as well as of all the matters raised by the Union in relation to the period 01.01.2024 - 31.12.2026 and in respect of which negotiations took place between the parties before the conclusion of this Agreement and the Union agrees that it will not during the continuance in force of this Agreement raise any of the matters which were discussed and negotiated between the parties preceding this Agreement."
